---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Introspect GraphQL schemas and send GraphQL operations

Usage: rustman graphql [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  introspect  Fetch an endpoint's schema by introspection and cache it (optionally writing it as SDL)
  query       Validate, send and print a GraphQL operation: a request file, or --endpoint with --query
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
